+## Queue Concurrency
+
+The render queue processes at most four rendering jobs concurrently. Queue depth is decoupled from cache state — a failed job or evicted sheet does not affect queue concurrency. Each enqueued job is assigned a unique ticket that clients poll at the specified retry interval.
